(text "Build 10 identical copies. This board has no active parts and no power supply.\n2.54 mm pairs are labelled by function, not motherboard physical pin number. Connect by motherboard manual.\nPin 9 goes to separately verified host signal ground. Pin 10 stays NC at both cable ends.\nTo save a separate PCBA setup: order bare PCBs and hand-solder connectors, or substitute a crimped Y harness."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid 862969e1-b420-5a63-8d46-44a43893b247))
